rectangle "**ControlNet 注入点**\n//unet_2d_condition.py:1232-1241, 1265-1266//\n\n**Down Block Skip 上叠加:**\nfor (skip, ctrl_residual) in zip(...):\n  skip = skip + ctrl_residual\n\n**Mid Block 输出上叠加:**\nsample = sample + mid_block_additional_residual\n\n**不改原始UNet权重!**\n只在 skip 和 mid 的输出上加残差\n→ 影响 Up Block 恢复细节的方式" as CONTROLNET #B2DFDB

